From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:11:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath11k: offload NSS WDS and recover its sessions

Adapt the R50 WDS/ext-vdev and MCBC contracts to the local NSS driver.
Keep peer generations, actual mapped AST indices and radio namespaces;
serialize bounded learning and aging work, and retire address records with
their peer. Check packet ownership and use host MEC filtering for NSS12.5.

Keep AP VLANs separate from WLAN vdevs, restore 4addr Ethernet conversion,
and require the versioned private registration API. Rejoin NSS stations
and notify userspace to renew encrypted AP sessions after firmware recovery.
Finish station cleanup when a crashed NSS WLAN cannot accept deletion.

Previous merged from (924-ath11k-offload-WDS-with-NSS-address-lifetimes.patch):
